      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "typography_role": "body"
      },
      "text": "主讲人建议：\n在女性受到的限制中，\n仍保留抗争与选择。",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "主讲人建议：\n在女性受到的限制中，\n仍保留抗争与选择。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "p15v2_110",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 665,
      "y": 1115,
      "width": 342,
      "height": 65.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#273348",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4226374,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3442056,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "typography_role": "body"
      },
      "text": "主讲人认为女性苦难可能增加\n对关系和人生意义的理解。",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "主讲人认为女性苦难可能增加\n对关系和人生意义的理解。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "p15v2_111",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 665,
      "y": 1188,
      "width": 394,
      "height": 65.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#273348",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1187147,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7450368,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "typography_role": "body"
      },
      "text": "这是主讲人的看法，不保证增益，\n也不赞美或要求苦难。",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这是主讲人的看法，不保证增益，\n也不赞美或要求苦难。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "p15v2_112",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1277,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 32.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#273348",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8981012,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2706382,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "typography_role": "body"
      },
      "text": "比例不确定；性别群体智慧与进化比较是主讲人的推断和价值判断，非科学定论。",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "比例不确定；性别群体智慧与进化比较是主讲人的推断和价值判断，非科学定论。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "p15v2_113",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1317,
      "width": 966,
      "height": 32.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#273348",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3847303,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5404171,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "typography_role": "body"
      },
      "text": "群体角色仅作范围示意，不编码比例；群体性别比较与进化类比不能推出个体优劣。",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "群体角色仅作范围示意，不编码比例；群体性别比较与进化类比不能推出个体优劣。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 26
    },
